---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { path, t, type Lang } from '../i18n/ui';
import { coverage, exploreRetention, first, int, last, one, retention, share } from '../lib/data';
import { lines } from '../lib/charts';

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const L = (pt: string, en: string) => (lang === 'pt' ? pt : en);
const from = first(coverage).ref_year;
const to = last(coverage).ref_year;
const all = retention.filter((r) => r.scope === 'all');
const recent = retention.filter((r) => r.scope === 'recent');
const at = (scope: 'all' | 'recent', age: number) => one(retention, { scope, age });
const band = (group: string) => one(exploreRetention, { group_type: 'price_band', scope: 'all', group, age: 5 });
const maxAge = last(all).age;
const labels = {
  all: L(`${from}–${to}`, `${from}–${to}`),
  recent: L(`${to - 4}–${to}`, `${to - 4}–${to}`),
};

const chart = lines(
  [
    ...all.map((r) => ({ series: 'all', label: labels.all, x: r.age, y: r.median_ratio })),
    ...recent.map((r) => ({ series: 'recent', label: labels.recent, x: r.age, y: r.median_ratio })),
  ],
  {
    domain: [0, 1],
    xLabel: L('idade (anos) →', 'age (years) →'),
    yFormat: (v) => share(v, lang),
    classes: { all: 'line', recent: 'line-ref' },
    aria: L(
      'Duas linhas descendo com a idade do carro: a parcela do preço de zero km que o carro mantém, em todos os janeiros e nos cinco mais recentes.',
      "Two lines falling with the car's age: the share of the brand-new price a car keeps, across all Januaries and in the five most recent.",
    ),
  },
);
---

<Base lang={lang} page="depreciation" title={L('Quanto um carro vale com o tempo', 'What a car is worth over time')}>
  <article class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">{t(lang, 'nav.analyses')}</p>
    <h1>{L(`Aos 5 anos, um carro vale ${share(at('all', 5).median_ratio, lang)} do novo`, `At 5 years, a car is worth ${share(at('all', 5).median_ratio, lang)} of a new one`)}</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      {L(
        `Em mediana, comparado ao mesmo carro zero km no mesmo janeiro: ${share(at('all', 1).median_ratio, lang)} com 1 ano, ${share(at('all', 5).median_ratio, lang)} com 5 e ${share(at('all', 10).median_ratio, lang)} com 10.`,
        `In the median, next to the same car brand new in the same January: ${share(at('all', 1).median_ratio, lang)} at 1 year, ${share(at('all', 5).median_ratio, lang)} at 5 and ${share(at('all', 10).median_ratio, lang)} at 10.`,
      )}
    </p>

    <figure class="figure">
      <Fragment set:html={chart} />
      <figcaption>
        {L(
          `Parcela mediana do preço de zero km que o carro mantém, por idade (ano de referência menos ano-modelo), até ${maxAge} anos. A divisão é feita no mesmo janeiro, então a inflação se cancela.`,
          `Median share of the brand-new price a car keeps, by age (reference year minus model year), up to ${maxAge} years. Both prices come from the same January, so inflation cancels out.`,
        )}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        {L(
          `Nos últimos cinco janeiros (${labels.recent}) a curva ficou um pouco mais alta: ${share(at('recent', 5).median_ratio, lang)} aos 5 anos e ${share(at('recent', 10).median_ratio, lang)} aos 10, num período que inclui a alta dos usados depois de 2021.`,
          `In the last five Januaries (${labels.recent}) the curve sat a little higher: ${share(at('recent', 5).median_ratio, lang)} at 5 years and ${share(at('recent', 10).median_ratio, lang)} at 10, a period that includes the used-car rise after 2021.`,
        )}
      </p>
      <p>
        {L(
          `Carro barato segura mais valor: aos 5 anos, o quinto mais barato dos zero km mantém ${share(band('q1').median_ratio, lang)}, e o quinto mais caro, ${share(band('q5').median_ratio, lang)}. `,
          `Cheaper cars hold value better: at 5 years, the cheapest fifth of brand-new cars keeps ${share(band('q1').median_ratio, lang)}, and the most expensive fifth ${share(band('q5').median_ratio, lang)}. `,
        )}
        <a href={path(lang, 'explore')}>{L('Compare marcas e combustíveis no Explorar', 'Compare brands and fuels in Explore')}</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        {L(
          `Só entram modelos que ainda têm preço de zero km naquele janeiro. Nas idades altas sobram os modelos de vida longa, e a amostra cai (de ${int(at('all', 0).n, lang)} pares com 0 ano para ${int(at('all', maxAge).n, lang)} com ${maxAge}). `,
          `Only models that still have a brand-new price in that January count. At high ages only long-lived models remain, and the sample shrinks (from ${int(at('all', 0).n, lang)} pairs at age 0 to ${int(at('all', maxAge).n, lang)} at ${maxAge}). `,
        )}
        <a href={path(lang, 'method')}>{t(lang, 'nav.method')}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <details class="data">
      <summary>{t(lang, 'table.show')}</summary>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="num">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>{L('Idade', 'Age')}</th>
              <th>{labels.all} · {t(lang, 'table.n')}</th>
              <th>{labels.all}</th>
              <th>{labels.recent} · {t(lang, 'table.n')}</th>
              <th>{labels.recent}</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {all.map((r) => {
              const rr = one(recent, { age: r.age });
              return (
                <tr>
                  <td>{r.age}</td>
                  <td>{int(r.n, lang)}</td>
                  <td>{share(r.median_ratio, lang, 1)}</td>
                  <td>{int(rr.n, lang)}</td>
                  <td>{share(rr.median_ratio, lang, 1)}</td>
                </tr>
              );
            })}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
  </article>
</Base>
